  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies the content capture version enabled for a session.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>These values represent the Android <c>ContentCaptureSession.VERSION_1</c> and <c>ContentCaptureSession.VERSION_2</c> constants. Read <see cref="P:Android.Views.ContentCaptures.ContentCaptureSession.ContentCaptureVersion" /> to select the notification methods for the session. Notification methods for the other version do not report changes.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/contentcapture/ContentCaptureSession#getContentCaptureVersion()">Android content capture versions</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
